@tradition night-owls-cocoa
// Night owls' cocoa (FX14, 0.92.5 item 16; SW1's pitch): Saturday late, after film night and the observatory, Davi Keane
// makes a big pot of cocoa in the bow lounge with the lights down low. Behind WEEKEND_ON.
// Host Kofi Mensah since FX9 (lead 34, 2026-10-24: Keane goes to bed at 22:46, too early to host; he stays a regular).
k: 463
title: Night owls' cocoa
// (the user, 2026-10-25: spread across weeks, two new a weekend; was: weekly saturday)
when: every 4 weeks saturday week 4 from day 1
at: 22:30-23:30
min: 20
// (DS1, RV14: a full room had you standing beside the leader; a seated weekend join keeps a seat for you)
spare: 1
jitter: 15
where: 3 room Bow lounge: lounge-seat, bench
hold: 1
who: mensah always, keane-davi always, night-owl 80%, late-sleeper 50%, stargazer 30%, everyone 8%
anim: drink
host: mensah
ties: decor cocoaPot
from: mensah

== mail
- Night owls' cocoa tomorrow from {time}, the bow lounge. Lights low, cocoa sweet. I'll pour. Pyjamas welcome, and so are bad jokes.

== ask
- Night owls' cocoa after film night. Mensah makes it far too sweet. It's perfect.   #funny
- Not ready for bed? Bow lounge, half ten. Cocoa and the stars.
- Mensah's pouring cocoa tonight. Go for the cocoa, stay for the stories.   #funny

== here
- Shh. Low voices. It's nearly midnight.
- Another mug? Go on, then. It's Saturday.   #warm
- Look at the windows. You never see them like this in the day.
- Mensah's telling the one about the airlock again. Still funny.   #funny
- Keane's on his third mug. It's his morning, really.   #funny

== thanks
- You curl up in the bow lounge with a mug. The lamps are low, the stars fill the curved windows, and Kofi Mensah keeps the cocoa coming and the stories going.

== chatter
- Stayed for night owls' cocoa. Slept like a stone. Recommended.   #funny
- Mensah's cocoa is mostly sugar. Nobody's complained yet.   #funny
- The late hour in the bow lounge is worth staying up for.   #warm
